#: title/pc5_ui.c:7079
msgid ""
"Alternative: slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't start or its "
"picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: långsammare än Auto. Prova det om spelet inte startar eller "
"bilden blir fel."

