msgstr "Vad %s skickar"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7334
msgid "The usual way for older games like this one, with their 2D and 3D."
msgstr "Det vanliga sättet för äldre spel som detta, med deras 2D och 3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7335
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Snabbast, och det de flesta spel vill ha. Låt det vara om inte spelet "
"vägrar starta eller bilden blir fel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7337
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game, slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Ett annat sätt att rita spelet, långsammare än Auto. Prova det om spelet "
"inte startar eller bilden blir fel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7339
msgid ""
"Draws everything in 2D, the way ordinary Windows programs are drawn. For a "
"2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen; a game with 3D "
"scenes won't start with it."
msgstr ""
"Ritar allt i 2D, så som vanliga Windows-program ritas. För ett 2D-spel som "
"flimrar eller bara visar en del av sin skärm; ett spel med 3D-scener "
"startar inte med det."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7341
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong with Auto; "
"faster than Compatibility. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Ett annat sätt att rita spelet. Prova det om bilden blir fel med Auto; "
"snabbare än Kompatibel. Vissa moddar behöver det."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7342
msgid ""
"The slowest, but it starts the most games. Try it if the game won't start "
"with the others."
msgstr ""
"Långsammast, men startar flest spel. Prova det om spelet inte startar med "
"de andra."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7363
#, c-format
msgid "The game uses %s"
msgstr "Spelet använder %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7375
msgid "In use"
msgstr "Används"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7395
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 kör dina PC-spel med prospero-win: Wine, DXVK för Direct3D 8 till 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton för Direct3D 12 och Mesa (RADV för Vulkan, Zink för OpenGL)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7397
msgid ""
"Covers come from Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki and Wikidata, and SteamGridDB "
"with your key. No game is part of PC5."
msgstr ""
"Omslagen kommer från Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki och Wikidata, och "
"SteamGridDB med din nyckel. Inget spel ingår i PC5."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7398
msgid "Free software under the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later."
msgstr "Fri programvara under GNU LGPL 2.1 eller senare."

